**/bin/
**/obj/
# Vendored third-party payloads at the repo root (BepInEx distribution) stay local. The pattern is anchored
# on purpose: an unanchored `tools/` also swallowed src/tools/, which is first-party source (D-062).
/tools/
artifacts/
dist/*
!dist/README.md
lib/
*.user
*.suo
# Never commit proprietary game DLLs/assets or personal saves.
backups/
docs/playtests/reports/
# Raw identifier reports remain local; summaries are recorded in living documents.